        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Stephens, James Hewitt, Gillian Caldwell\n- Organizations: Howard Kennedy LLP, Global Witness, International Corporate Accountability Roundtable, EarthRights International, Human Rights Watch, Human Rights First, Amnesty International\n- Roles: solicitor, Executive Director, Chair, cavalry officer, Steering Committee\n- Topics: media law, intellectual property rights, human rights\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Stephens was born on 7 April 1957.\n- James Hewitt was born on 30 April 1958.\n- Mark Stephens is an English solicitor specialising in media law, intellectual property rights, and human rights with Howard Kennedy LLP.\n- James Hewitt is an English former cavalry officer in the British Army.\n- Gillian Caldwell joined Global Witness as Executive Director in July 2015.\n- Mark Stephens was appointed Chair of Global Witness in March 2016.\n- The International Corporate Accountability Roundtable's Steering Committee includes EarthRights International, Human Rights Watch, Human Rights First, Global Witness, and Amnesty International.",
